@startuml system-realization
title System Realization ; per ADR-ES-027 section 5 + CR-ES-027 section 7

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Element Organization" as EOrg
class "Behavioral Coherence" as BCo
class "System Boundary" as SBnd
class "Intended Functions" as IFn
class "Intended Purposes" as IPurp
class "Intended Outcomes" as IOut
class "Contextual Operation" as COp

EOrg --> BCo : foundation
BCo --> SBnd : constraint
SBnd --> IFn : realization
IFn --> IPurp : purpose
IPurp --> IOut : outcomes
IOut --> COp : operationalization

note bottom of COp
  Per ADR-ES-027 section 3 + section 5:
  System accommodates business, information, technical,
  socio-technical, operational, and distributed systems.
end note

@enduml
